What is {{order-client}} {{/rides/order/stopFindNewDriver}}?

* This endpoint stops Background Matching:
** {{order-core-integrations}} {{/internal/order/client/stopBackgroundMatching}}
*** {{order-core}} {{/internal/stopBackgroundMatching}} - updates Redis cache only
*** {{sendBackgroundMatchingStopped}}
**** {{ride-matching-ingestion}} {{onBackgroundMatchingStopped}} ({{BackgroundMatchingService.handleBackgroundMatchingStopped}})
***** {{ride-matching-offer}} {{/internal/order/rejectAllOffers}}
****** {{order-core-integrations}} {{/internal/orderTry/offer/createInCancelledState}}  
* This endpoint is implemented for [https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ENGINEERING/pages/5031985593/2024+Q3+Find+a+new+driver|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ENGINEERING/pages/5031985593/2024+Q3+Find+a+new+driver|smart-link].

This means that {{order-core-v2}} {{/internal/orderTry/offer/createInCancelledState}} shouldn’t check the order state in this case: it’s expected that the order state is {{active}}.

