* We also need to determine whether the delivery of waste to disposal or processing sites must be pre-authorised or accepted by the relevant waste treatment operators. {color:#ff5630}Clear{color}

*Points to note:*

* Vehicles used in this service must be individually registered as a waste carrier with ERA. {color:#ff5630}Ok{color}
* The type of waste being collected matters — different categories (e.g. municipal, bulky, hazardous) may require additional permits or compliance obligations. {color:#ff5630}Ok{color}
* Noncompliance (e.g. using unregistered vehicles, improper handling, or transporting unauthorised waste) may result in fines, denial of access to disposal sites, or regulatory action. {color:#ff5630}Ok{color} {color:#ff5630}- will the liability be fully on the operator or even on us in this case as a platform? would we be defined as a broker?{color}
